{
  "$schemaNote": "Default convolution filter library for CT5.A4.DAG. Each filter is a 2D array of floating point numbers in row x column order. 'normalize' (if true) means the kernel should be divided by the sum of its values before being applied; leave false for kernels already normalized (e.g. identity).",
